  "text": "52. The liberation of the whole nation, in 1949, was a great change ____.\nA) in nature  B) by nature\nC) of nature  D) against nature\n53. The hill is ____ of trees.\nA) empty  B) rude\nC) hollow  D) bare\n54. From this date, a new ____ in the history of mankind takes its beginning.\nA) area  B) period\nC) era  D) ages\n55. Do what you are told and don't argue ____ me.\nA) for  B) with\nC) about  D) from\n56. The ____ country for the next Olympic Games is Japan.\nA) host  B) guest\nC) designer  D) master\n57. A club is a place to make frequent ____ with friends.\nA) contrast  B) contract\nC) contact  D) content\n58. In a case of murder, the police question everyone who might have a ____.\nA) relation  B) impulse\nC) incentive  D) motive\n59. Man is controlled by his ____ as well as by reason.\nA) instincts  B) distinct\nC) institution  D) impulse\n60. The house has a ____ over the sea.\nA) image  B) sight\nC) view  D) outlook\n61. He still has great talent, but he has lost ____ in himself.\nA) faint  B) failure\nC) future  D) faith\n62. We learn to ____ before we learn to walk.\nA) run  B) crawl\nC) shout  D) jump\n63. When I turned to the person ____ next to me, I recognized that he was my schoolmate.\nA) seating  B) sit\nC) seated  D) sat\n64. My mouth waters at the ____ of those peaches.\nA) sight  B) look\nC) picture  D) view\n65. The room ____ when she walks in.\nA) lights  B) lights up\nC) comes to light  D) sets light\n66. All citizens should help the police in ____ the criminals.\nA) taking down  B) putting down\nC) looking down  D) tracking down\n67. Darwin is a British naturalist who had ____ great contribution.\nA) made  B) done\nC) given  D) found\n68. What really ____ is whether you have really realized your mistakes.\nA) accounts  B) counts\nC) assumes  D) contracts\n69. All I can remember when I ____ is my mother's anxious face.\nA) came about  B) came up\nC) came to  D) came on\n70. At the first light of dawn the warships ____ the open sea.\nA) longed for  B) felt like\nC) made out  D) made for\n71. The people of Africa have successfully fought ____ colonial rule.\nA) for  B) with\nC) against  D) without",
