  "label": "选择题强化训练（二） 第 89–105 题",
  "text": "89. Noticing that my daughter was very shy, our hostess ____ to make her feel at home.\nA) snapped her fingers  B) went out of her way\nC) was round the corner  D) came down in the world\n90. I don't really want to make any ____ on the decisions they made.\nA) appointments  B) compliments\nC) judgments  D) conclusions\n91. Many authors use ____ names when they publish their books.\nA) fake  B) favorite\nC) flaw  D) false\n92. Many Americans choose to travel by car ____ by any means of transportation.\nA) other than  B) rather than\nC) better than  D) more than\n93. This program aims to make the country ____ in oil and other resources.\nA) self-conscious  B) self-respecting\nC) self-sufficient  D) self-educated\n94. His last year's trousers are now ____ and need lengthening a little.\nA) outgrown  B) worn out\nC) outdated  D) out of fashion\n95. The death of Mr. Black ____ the final breaking up of the family.\nA) organized  B) involved\nC) occupied  D) hastened\n96. A ____ youth was taken into custody for drug use.\nA) 17-year-old  B) 17-years-old\nC) 17-years-olds  D) 17-year-olds\n97. Although ____ in years, Thomas Edison remained as active and creative as many young people.\nA) previous  B) advanced\nC) fragile  D) strong\n98. Jim, a heartless fellow, was heard ____ at his mother in the dead of night.\nA) laughing  B) murmuring\nC) shouting  D) whistling\n99. It took him a long time to ____ the skills he needed to become a professional artist.\nA) enquire  B) inquire\nC) require  D) acquire\n100. Every time they have an argument, his wife ____ to leave him.\nA) agrees  B) threatens\nC) refuses  D) proceeds\n101. They enrolled all the school-age children though they were ____ teachers.\nA) abundant of  B) composed of\nC) in search of  D) short of\n102. The United States of America ____ fifty states.\nA) comprises of  B) consists of\nC) makes up  D) composes of\n103. ____ what he said, it is very unlikely that he'll support your application.\nA) Considering  B) Doubting\nC) Thinking  D) Believing\n104. Though you will face many difficulties, your final success is certain if you ____ working hard.\nA) insist on  B) insist in\nC) persist in  D) persist on\n105. The developing countries in Asia, Africa and Latin America ____ the third world.\nA) constitute  B) divide\nC) involve  D) institute",
